        <h1 style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);">Linear Oak in Santa Barbara: A Pronorm Kitchen That Belongs Under the Beams</h1>
        <p class="subtitle" style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">A beamed California ranch with skylights and a garden window — and a Pronorm Linear oak kitchen that brings German precision into a warm, wood-forward room without ever feeling out of place.</p>
        <div class="article-meta">
          <span>By Pronorm USA</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <time datetime="2026-05-04">May 4, 2026</time>
          <span>·</span>
