          <li>Sub-Zero French-door refrigerator (stainless)</li>
          <li>Sub-Zero undercounter wine refrigerator (island)</li>
          <li>Wolf professional gas range with griddle</li>
          <li>Wolf wall oven</li>
          <li>Sharp microwave drawer</li>
          <li>Integrated dishwasher</li>
        </ul>

        <img src="/images/magazine/santa-barbara-linear-oak/05-sink-garden-window-detail.webp" alt="Sink detail with bridge faucet and water filter, garden window framed behind" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;border-radius:4px;margin:2rem 0;" />

